Team files for the whole site
=============================
Put team .json files in this folder (on GitHub: Add file > Upload files, into the "teams" folder).
Everyone who opens the game gets these teams automatically, including a friend with an empty browser.
It can take a minute or two for the site to update after you upload.

How to make a file:
 - Teams read by the card reader already come as .json files. You can upload those directly.
 - To include a logo and your custom players, open the game, go to the setup page, scroll to
   "Your custom players" and use "Export a team file for the site". Upload the file it downloads.

If someone has also imported the same team in their own browser, their browser copy is used instead
of the site copy (that is how custom players stay on the right device).
To replace a team, upload a file with the same name; to remove one, delete its file.
